.Dd October 28, 2026
.Dt UUIDGEN 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm uuidgen
.Nd generate a Universally Unique Identifier
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl hdr
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
prints a new random (version 4) UUID in upper case, as
.Dq 5C1BE7F0-2B6E-4F8A-9D3C-0A8E1F2B3C4D .
.Pp
The option is:
.Bl -tag -width "-hdr"
.It Fl hdr
Print the UUID as a comment and a
.Ql #define
of a
.Fn CFUUIDGetConstantUUIDWithBytes
call, for a C header.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr uuid 3
